71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JB0s_8DU8LMQ7kNvwEq-Bt1&_nc_oc=AdoKj6S-IsI9-w53AyJXOUIfVSgUuWCd1QplocDA5DwrrVPOLNT03yzyLlfs4SPlzG8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8MNQGFaMjiGgZbjKRwTzw7apUodiCluc6Mk7FfGPkLaw&oe=6A33EE39"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0p2iRHXGOtoQ7kNvwEaVzl6&_nc_oc=AdrA64EujbXcOOgpoKlPalMDrf71akXGjWIzfm2maUbs3YcFdIviLsSLt-BURyyu32k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8NTdsBveUtNcTDq9qRWjUM6cbVmWfvt6CnPlVN4oTdTg&oe=6A340113"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Vj0NDK7kZmYQ7kNvwHKHHE0&_nc_oc=AdoZweRZAcakUsWrvq2iALCsIXq1Dtr_kGvVjL-VkW4av1nwt8uoJoCIcRwiXr4Lg1c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8YPqPxpL-pKqYnPZQTKWoI3J3S_J5S3H-veNew8isfPA&oe=6A33FF5A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: